WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.733
Video twenty-two. Backup, daily backup, and
restore.

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:08.818
Your books are on your PC. Hisaab keeps copies
of them.

00:00:08.748 --> 00:00:12.565
Every day, Hisaab backs up every company by
itself.

00:00:12.495 --> 00:00:16.380
Hisaab Drive puts an encrypted copy outside
this PC.

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.594
With a backup, you restore the company at any
time.

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:22.911
The Gateway shows the last backup of the
company.

00:00:24.394 --> 00:00:28.477
Alt+Y opens the Data menu. Enter opens Backup
& Restore.

00:00:28.507 --> 00:00:32.057
B is Backup. The company is already selected.

00:00:32.087 --> 00:00:37.173
Ctrl+A, then Enter, takes the backup now. The
new file is in the list.

00:00:40.137 --> 00:00:46.222
L opens the Daily Backup. It is on from the first
day: every day at 13:00, with 7 versions.

00:00:46.252 --> 00:00:50.603
When the PC is off at that time, the backup
runs after the next start.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:56.050
F10 shows every backup file. The files of the
daily backup have Daily in the name.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:03.148
When the PC breaks or is lost, the copy on it
is lost too. F9 sets up a copy outside.

00:01:03.178 --> 00:01:08.927
Google Drive or OneDrive: sign in one time. Or
pick a folder, like a USB disk.

00:01:09.042 --> 00:01:13.859
Then a backup password. Hisaab encrypts the
copy before it leaves this PC.

00:01:14.485 --> 00:01:18.970
Write down the recovery key. It opens the copy
when the password is lost.

00:01:22.285 --> 00:01:27.236
Now the company has a copy outside this PC. A
new copy goes there every day.

00:01:31.135 --> 00:01:35.154
R restores a backup. Select the file, and
press Enter.

00:01:35.797 --> 00:01:41.480
This company is still here. So Hisaab restores the
backup as a new company, with a new number.

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:44.861
Yes loads it. Now both companies are open.

00:01:46.219 --> 00:01:50.036
Back up every day, and keep one copy outside
this PC.

00:01:49.966 --> 00:01:53.516
Next: users, passwords, and the Edit Log.

